attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on a single persistent column.** Column 0, `hldE`, is carried by 100% of chromosomes, in a region of plasticity in 0% of calls, and the model names 99% of them at 0.02 bits {S1}. Then columns 1-2, `ibsE`, are variable, carried by 54 to 84%, fewest named at column 1, 63% {S2}.

@variable **A fork and variable stretch follows at columns 6-9**, carried by 46 to 56%, fewest named at column 7, 75% {S4}. A branch of 3 families runs through columns 7-9 in 11%, [[pilus]] {S4.b7, Q}. The long spine at columns 33-59, `parC` to `gss`, is [[hydrogenase]] at columns 50-55 {S11, Q}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine columns than on the fork and variable ones**, 94 against 82%, and hesitates less there, 0.18 against 0.57 bits {M}. Its most hesitant column, 61, `yghT`, is a fork column, at 1.14 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends in a fork and variable stretch.** Columns 60-79 are carried by 42 to 76%, the most plastic stretch of the window, in a region of plasticity in 54 to 86% of calls {S12, P}. The last column is `glcB`, in 42% of chromosomes {E}.

@whole **Across the window it names 89% of genes**, 0.33 bits on average, perplexity 1.6 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 0.80 against 0.15 bits, and names fewer genes, 75% against 95% {C}.

